        "faq1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where does it fit in an existing programme?",
            "answer": "<p>It doesn’t replace fuelling, protein or sleep, and it isn’t a pre-workout. It works a layer beneath all of those, on the cell’s capacity to convert the session into an adaptation. Doses are printed in full, so overlap with what is already in the programme is visible rather than guessed at.</p>",
